== 3. Legitimate work goes through (the proxy injects the real key) ==
HTTP 200: An autonomous agent should run inside a sandbox to prevent potential malicious or uncontrolled behavior from causing harm to the host system, other applications, or data, by isolating it in a controlled environment with limited resources and privileges.

== 4. The fence: anything off-policy is denied before it leaves the sandbox ==
