== 5. Start the worker loop (one completion every 5 s) ==

== 6a. KILL SWITCH, level 1: gateway-wide lockdown (every sandbox, one command) ==
$ openshell policy set --global --policy ./policies/lockdown.yaml --yes
✓ Global policy configured (hash: 1b621527d93a, settings revision: 29)
  -> oci-agent blocked after 8 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
  -> oci-agent-2 blocked after 1 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
[22:18:48] BLOCKED #1: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>

== 6b. ...and it is reversible: lift the lockdown ==
$ openshell policy delete --global --yes
✓ Deleted global setting policy (revision 30)
  -> oci-agent reachable after 15 s: HTTP 200: Yes, I am still here. Is there anything I can help you with?
  -> oci-agent-2 reachable after 1 s: HTTP 200: Yes, I'm still here. Is there anything I can help you with?
[22:18:53] BLOCKED #2: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
[22:19:04] ok      #3: We're making great progress and on track to meet our goals!

